@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Policies";
}
<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="mb-5">Policies</h1>
</div>
<div class="mb-5">
    <h5 class="mt-5 text-center">
        Pricing
    </h5>
    <p>The pricing of all of our products are exactly as displayed and are non-negotiable. In the event of a sale, discounts may be applied and will be clearly indicated on our website.</p>
</div>
<div class="mb-5">
    <h5 class="mt-5 text-center">
        Privacy
    </h5>
    <p>We value your privacy and respect your personal information. As such, the only data stored will be those necessary to process your transaction and ship your products. This information will never be sold.</p>
</div>
<div class="mb-5">
    <h5 class="mt-5 text-center">
        Shipping Costs
    </h5>
    <p>A flat $5 fee will be applied to each order before tax to account for shipping. JCL does not ship outside of the US at this time.</p>
</div>
<div class="mb-5">
    <h5 class="mt-5 text-center">
        Tax Policy
    </h5>
    <p>A 7.5% sales tax is applied after shipping costs are added to the total order amount.</p>
</div>
<div>
    <h5 class="mt-5 text-center">
        Return Policy
    </h5>
    <p>JCL accepts returned packages within 2 weeks of delivery, as long as they are returned in original packaging. We offer a full refund on returned packages, excluding shipping costs. If you require assistance, contact our support team at (904) 555-0122.</p>
</div>